{"unit_id":"edusrez__dsh-tool-web-enhanced#card-zh","repo":"edusrez/dsh-tool-web-enhanced","commit":"c3290d0dedb020814833a1f027a4e9ce97bc0035","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-web-enhanced 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 的网页搜索扩展，将原生 web_search 与可选的 SearXNG、Parallel 搜索和本地 Markdown RAG 结果按来源分区呈现。它注册增强搜索工具，支持 topic 分类和 sources 选择，并可自动建立本地向量索引及按需添加 Parallel Extract 抓取提供器。适合需要组合联网搜索与个人文档检索的 DSH 用户；本地检索可用本地 embedding，远程能力需按配置提供服务地址或 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:525-604","src/index.ts:695-787","src/modules.ts:274-294","src/modules.ts:454-489","src/modules.ts:831-860"]}
